{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10297090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1029709001:0":{"text":"세상에, 모래바람이 무슨... 각오는 했지만 이렇게 심할 줄은 몰랐어요.","source_cn":"天啊，这里的风沙……我做过心理准备了，还是没想到这么厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7F6EBABC33DFDDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029709002:0":{"text":"바람에 날려오는 모래가 얼굴을 채찍으로 때리는 것 같아요! 콜록, 콜록. 퉤!","source_cn":"风卷着沙子，就像铁鞭一样往人脸上抽——咳咳咳，呸呸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF04C760DE5F2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029709002":{"text":"바람에 날려오는 모래가 얼굴을 채찍으로 때리는 것 같아요! 콜록, 콜록. 퉤!","source_cn":"风卷着沙子，就像铁鞭一样往人脸上抽——咳咳咳，呸呸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAF04C760DE5F2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029709003:0":{"text":"네. 입만 벌리면 들어오네요. 게다가 여긴 너무 건조해요.","source_cn":"是，一张嘴就会飞进来，而且这附近太干燥了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10170E44FFCBBA29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029709004:0":{"text":"블레다크 1세도 풀이 죽은 것 같아요...","source_cn":"连布拉达克一世好像都蔫了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A91C4A56BE001D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"",